  "gaps": [
    "code = refusalReasonCode (returned as a string, e.g. \"6\"). The human-readable refusalReason is a separate field and is included as refusalReason.",
    "The test card numbers page does not mention holderName triggers. Those come from the testing/result-codes page, whose example uses card 4111111111111111 with expiry 03/2030 and CVC 737. The docs do not say the triggers only work on that card, but no other card appears in the examples.",
    "The docs give no retry guidance for most codes. retryable is true only for codes whose description says to retry (38, 42) and for acquirer-side or issuer-availability errors (4, 9). It is false only for card-state or fraud refusals where retrying the same card cannot help, which is our inference.",
    "Codes 40 (Current AID is in Penalty Box) and 41 (CVM Required Restart Payment) say to retry, but they are point-of-sale oriented, so they are left out. PIN codes (17, 18, 19, 33, 36, 43-45) and account-type codes (34, 35) are also left out as card-present.",
    "No amount-based triggers are documented for card refusals.",
    "Not re-verified in this pass: 5201281505129736 (3DS2 frictionless). It is in the repo presets but this pass did not fetch the 3DS2 testing page."
  ]
